{"4211700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Violent Nature", "steam_appid": 4211700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/5afc2169d82538ebb74954da9740827e.poster.avif?t=1786300593\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/5afc2169d82538ebb74954da9740827e.webm?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/5afc2169d82538ebb74954da9740827e.mp4?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violent Nature is an open world survival horror game set in a small town after an interdimensional invasion. Manage your overall health and resources, explore, and improve your gear as you push back the spread of an infectous growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Status management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain your overall health by keeping yourself fed and hydrated. Strength can be replenished by sleeping. Keep infection down by dodging attacks from infected enemies, avoiding vines, and finding medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you can carry depends on the quality of your backpack and clothing. Carry weight adds up quick and will slow you down. Keep up strength to better manage large carry weights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noise</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/60f20638b60a1de063a96971bad5278b.poster.avif?t=1786300593\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/60f20638b60a1de063a96971bad5278b.webm?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/60f20638b60a1de063a96971bad5278b.mp4?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth to avoid confrontation. Crouch to reduce noise. Gun shots and other loud noises will attract large groups of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures to aid survival such as a campfire or rain catcher. Combine items to create useful tools such as bandages and Molotovs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/bfcac905e469c3c2f92123b2a072c5a8.poster.avif?t=1786300593\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/bfcac905e469c3c2f92123b2a072c5a8.webm?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/bfcac905e469c3c2f92123b2a072c5a8.mp4?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and the environment are obscured when not in the players cone of vision. When exploring enclosed spaces line of sight is limited. Enemies can sneak up at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character by adjusting the body shape and selecting from sets of hair and colors. Equipped clothing and items appear on your character.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/5afc2169d82538ebb74954da9740827e.poster.avif?t=1786300593\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/5afc2169d82538ebb74954da9740827e.webm?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/5afc2169d82538ebb74954da9740827e.mp4?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violent Nature is an open world survival horror game set in a small town after an interdimensional invasion. Manage your overall health and resources, explore, and improve your gear as you push back the spread of an infectous growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Status management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain your overall health by keeping yourself fed and hydrated. Strength can be replenished by sleeping. Keep infection down by dodging attacks from infected enemies, avoiding vines, and finding medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you can carry depends on the quality of your backpack and clothing. Carry weight adds up quick and will slow you down. Keep up strength to better manage large carry weights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noise</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/60f20638b60a1de063a96971bad5278b.poster.avif?t=1786300593\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/60f20638b60a1de063a96971bad5278b.webm?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/60f20638b60a1de063a96971bad5278b.mp4?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth to avoid confrontation. Crouch to reduce noise. Gun shots and other loud noises will attract large groups of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures to aid survival such as a campfire or rain catcher. Combine items to create useful tools such as bandages and Molotovs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/bfcac905e469c3c2f92123b2a072c5a8.poster.avif?t=1786300593\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/bfcac905e469c3c2f92123b2a072c5a8.webm?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211700/extras/bfcac905e469c3c2f92123b2a072c5a8.mp4?t=1786300593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and the environment are obscured when not in the players cone of vision. When exploring enclosed spaces line of sight is limited. Enemies can sneak up at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character by adjusting the body shape and selecting from sets of hair and colors. Equipped clothing and items appear on your character.</p>", "short_description": "Violent Nature is an open world survival game set in a small town after an interdimensional invasion. Manage your status and limited resources as you fight weaponized creatures and push back the spread of cracks to the other side.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.a